  "query": "As someone working in education, help me understand whether artificial intelligence will fundamentally transform how we teach and assess student learning, or if it's just another educational technology trend that will fade. I want to analyze (1) what the most popular AI tools are and how they're changing student research, writing, and problem-solving processes, (2) whether research shows that personalized AI tutoring and adaptive learning systems can actually improve educational outcomes better than human instruction, or if they're creating new forms of educational inequality, and (3) how different educational institutions globally are adapting their curricula, honor codes, and teaching methods to integrate rather than ban AI tools. There is no need to restrict to a specific country or region. In your report, you should focus on evidence and data from 2022 onwards."
